<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Modern Login</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/OurBeliefs.css">
    <script src="~/js/site.js"></script>
</head>

<body>





    @*stylish font title*@
    <div class="stylishfonttitle-outer-container">
        <div class="stylishfonttitle-silver-bar"></div>

        <div class="stylishfonttitle-header-box">
            <h1 class="stylishfonttitle-text">
                Church<span> Beliefs</span>
            </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="stylishfonttitle-silver-bar"></div>
    </div>




    @*beliefs display section*@
    <section class="ourbeliefs-grid-section">
        <div class="ourbeliefs-container">
            <header class="ourbeliefs-header">
                @*<span class="ourbeliefs-accent">Core Values</span>
                <h2 class="ourbeliefs-main-title">What We Stand For</h2>*@
            </header>

            <div class="ourbeliefs-grid">
                <div class="ourbeliefs-card">
                    <div class="ourbeliefs-icon-box">🕊️</div>
                    <h3 class="ourbeliefs-card-title">Grace</h3>
                    <p class="ourbeliefs-card-text">We believe in unconditional love and the power of transformation through faith.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ourbeliefs-card">
                    <div class="ourbeliefs-icon-box">📖</div>
                    <h3 class="ourbeliefs-card-title">Truth</h3>
                    <p class="ourbeliefs-card-text">Guided by ancient wisdom interpreted for a modern, evolving world.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ourbeliefs-card">
                    <div class="ourbeliefs-icon-box">🤝</div>
                    <h3 class="ourbeliefs-card-title">Unity</h3>
                    <p class="ourbeliefs-card-text">A diverse community walking together in authentic, shared fellowship.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ourbeliefs-book-wrapper">
        <div class="ourbeliefs-book-container">
            <article class="ourbeliefs-book-page">
                <p class="ourbeliefs-book-text">
                    It is in the quiet moments of reflection that we truly understand our purpose.
                    Our journey is not one taken in isolation, but a collective unfolding of faith
                    and discovery. Like the ancient scribes who carefully preserved the truths
                    of old, we continue to write our story on the hearts of our community.
                    Every act of kindness is a new sentence, and every moment of shared
                    vulnerability is a chapter in our shared history. We believe that the
                    narrative of grace is still being written today, and you are an
                    essential character in this divine anthology of light and restoration.
                    As we turn the pages of tomorrow, we do so with the courage of those
                    who walked before us, carrying the lantern of hope into the unknown
                    corners of the world.
                </p>
                <footer class="ourbeliefs-book-signature">— The Ministry Records, Vol. I</footer>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>



</body>
</html>